# Keep image build context small + avoid leaking dev state.
#
# Without this, `COPY . .` in the Next.js Dockerfiles would drag in
# host-side node_modules, .next caches, sealed-secret unsealed files,
# and Go vendor dirs — fat images and potential credential leaks.

# Node
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/dist
**/.cache
**/.vite

# Go
**/vendor
**/bin
**/*.test
**/__debug_bin*

# Python
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache

# Editor / OS
.idea
.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Git
.git
.gitignore
.github

# Local secrets — never bake into images
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
infra/k3s/_secrets/*.yaml
!infra/k3s/_secrets/*.sealed.yaml

# Misc
**/README.md
docs/
ops/runbooks/
